# Golem

Instance `res://addons/golem/player/player.tscn`.

The body and the camera collide with physics layer 2 unless that instance overrides them.

Leave files under `vendor/golem` and `addons/golem` unchanged. Tune the instanced player's exports. From the game root, update with `sh addons/golem/update.sh`.

Do not copy this repo's tests or its gdUnit4.

Name the node `Player` and attach `res://addons/golem/menu/golem_world.gd` only when the level should open the Escape menu.

The debug HUD stays in the player scene and starts hidden.

Action names, default keys, and the `toggle_mouse_mode` / `mouse_mode` split are in `addons/golem/docs/using-in-a-game.md`.
